<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus June CPI drops 0.07 pct month/month.</title>
<headline>Cyprus June CPI drops 0.07 pct month/month.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's consumer price index dropped by 0.07 percent month-on-month in June to 119.56 from 119.64 in May, the statistics and research department said.</p>
<p>The index (base 1992 = 100) was 115.99 in June 1996.</p>
<p>Decreases have been noted in the price of fresh vegetables and electricity, while the prices of some fresh fruits have risen, the statistics department said in a news release.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 469625</p>
</text>
